-25/38974897_794174735213402_5658923504426439013_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Hlp6OCYqv70Q7kNvwGABj7J&_nc_oc=AdqJj_VN9Iwz_Xgwq2XoWCcaAnAvLSAmWtgKx3nG9mnueZTOB0wO1e7xzpkXqg2D3cM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afxo1KdDq8Z023xfy-eAV7v3QxM1DtWIhPQ7NFODz4vrWA&oe=69D0FB4C"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "vidthumb.png", "id": "419702353686012", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031447_419702357019345_1078684321555486491_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8a0Fhq9mL54Q7kNvwHzscdn&_nc_oc=AdrbHpjMVlgFIHWVfvpnQK2XuBcPBCLbJyzhBuouryvqU-UHVqVpygbxSpbjsvwHzYc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afw6VRrBfGyJGeZqkOCw0hsbdubRKVkOuIlbigSWmp0YVw&oe=69D0F540"}, "display_name": "FloatVR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "\u2605WHAT WILL YOU EXPERIENCE TODAY?\u2605\nFLOAT through a world generated anew every time you visit.\nLISTEN music arranged and composed especially for you. \nEXPAND your perspective with spoken observations.\nDISCOVER rare creatures and interactive objects.\n\u2193\n\u2605 HEALING: Experience an instant feeling of wellness\n\u2605 EVER CHANGING: Never experience the same thing twice\n\u2605 INFINITE: stay as long as you like.\n\u2193\nWhen you need to reset and recharge...\nWhen you need a break from your own thoughts...\nWhen you need to just BE...\nFLOAT IS ALWAYS HERE FOR YOU.  ", "short_description": "\u2605WHAT WILL YOU EXPERIENCE TODAY?\u2605\nFLOAT through a world generated anew every time you visit.\nLISTEN music arranged and composed especially for you. \nEXPAND your perspective with spoken observations.\nWATCH strange creatures doing their thing. \n\u2193\n\u2605 HEALING: Experience an instant feeling of wellness\n\u2605 EVER CHANGING: Never experience the same thing twice\n\u2605 INFINITE: stay as long as you like.\n\u2193\nWhen you need a break from your own thoughts...\nFLOAT IS ALWAYS HERE F